abstract: >-
  RoninForge Akashi is a keyless MCP server health checker that verifies a Model
  Context Protocol server is alive and conformant using only public,
  unauthenticated probes, and emits an embeddable verified-on-date badge. It is
  MIT licensed, runs entirely on your machine, and requires no API keys. Akashi
  is the instrument behind the State of MCP census.
